@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "FAQ";
}

<section class="band">
    <div class="wrap faq">
        <h1>Frequently asked questions</h1>

        <h2 class="faqh">About ECHT GROUP</h2>
        <details>
            <summary>What does ECHT GROUP do?</summary>
            <p>We advise growing businesses across four areas: marketing, strategic market development, legal and compliance, and IT. Our consultants plan these together, so your decisions rest on one clear plan.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>Who is ECHT GROUP for?</summary>
            <p>Businesses that want to grow without blind spots, such as a marketing plan that has had a legal check, or a new market with the right systems behind it.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>How do you work with clients?</summary>
            <p>In three steps. We listen to your business and goals first. We then give you a clear roadmap with priorities, owners, timelines and costs. Finally, we work alongside your team and track results.</p>
        </details>

        <h2 class="faqh">Booking</h2>
        <details>
            <summary>How do I book a consultation?</summary>
            <p>Create an account or sign in, choose a service, then pick a date and a time slot. Your booking appears under My bookings.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>Can I cancel a booking?</summary>
            <p>Yes. Open My bookings and choose Cancel next to any future booking. The time slot becomes available again.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>Do I have to pay to book?</summary>
            <p>No. Online payments are not part of the site.</p>
        </details>

        <h2 class="faqh">Your account</h2>
        <details>
            <summary>Do I need an account?</summary>
            <p>You can browse the site, send a message through the Contact page and use the chat assistant without one. You need an account to book, to message a consultant from your dashboard and to write a review.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>What can I change on my profile?</summary>
            <p>Your name, title, contact numbers, alternative email, address and photo. Your main email address is shown but cannot be edited.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>I work at ECHT GROUP. How do I sign up?</summary>
            <p>Choose ECHT GROUP employee when you register. You will need your department and the staff code for it, which ECHT GROUP gives you.</p>
        </details>

        <h2 class="faqh">Messages and the chat assistant</h2>
        <details>
            <summary>How do I contact a consultant?</summary>
            <p>Signed in, open Messages and choose the topic you need help with. Your message goes to the matching department. Without an account, use the Contact page or the chat assistant.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>What is the chat assistant?</summary>
            <p>An automated helper at the bottom right of every page. It answers simple questions about our services and booking. For anything detailed, it refers you to the relevant department so a consultant can answer you.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>Why were my details asked for when I contacted you?</summary>
            <p>So a consultant can reply to you. Your information is used only to answer you and manage your account, as described in our <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
        </details>

        <h2 class="faqh">Reviews</h2>
        <details>
            <summary>Can I write a review?</summary>
            <p>Yes, once you have an account. You can choose a rating from one to five stars and add a few words. You can edit your review later.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>What is shown with my review?</summary>
            <p>Your first name and the first letter of your surname, for example Buhle M., together with your rating and text.</p>
        </details>

        <h2 class="faqh">Your information</h2>
        <details>
            <summary>Who can see my details?</summary>
            <p>Only you and the consultants in the department handling your request can see your messages and bookings. Reviews are public, as described above.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>How do I ask for my information to be corrected or deleted?</summary>
            <p>Update what you can on your profile page. For anything else, contact us using the details in our <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
        </details>

        <p class="lead">Can’t find your answer? <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Contact">Contact us</a>.</p>
    </div>
</section>